/**
 * Golden cases (`test/fixtures/thinking.json`, generated by `tools/fixturegen/thinking`) whose output predates an
 * upstream change Commissary has ported, by case key: the new output each must produce (ticket C1, Go `ad9e456d`).
 * The fixture JSON stays untouched; F2 (#388) regenerates it and deletes this module.
 *
 * - `validate`: a model with levels and no `zeroAllowed: true` cannot be turned off, so an off request to a Claude
 *   target now becomes its lowest canonical level (it stayed `none` before), and on other targets the lowest level
 *   replaces `levels[0]`.
 * - `apply`: the same, through `applyThinking`, with `display: "omitted"` (the caller asked for no thinking).
 * - `applier`: the Claude applier given a zero budget replaces the whole `thinking` object like any other off
 *   (`{"type":"disabled"}`), instead of `enabled` with `budget_tokens: 0`.
 */
